OL,3,GNEWSAAre AI models the next big danger
OL,4,Afor body image?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAI models are popping up more and more
OL,7,Facross social media and advertising,
OL,8,Fbut how might this affect body image?
OL,10,FMia Perumal, who has recovered from an
OL,11,Feating disorder, said she's worried the
OL,12,Ftechnology could make unrealistic
OL,13,Fbeauty standards even harder for young
OL,14,Fpeople to escape.
OL,16,FThe 19-year-old Cardiff University
OL,17,Fstudent said she believes if she'd had
OL,18,Faccess to AI during her eating
OL,19,Fdisorder, it would have had a "terrible
OL,20,Fimpact".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
